{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the mysterious realm of the Weird World where the mind manifests as physical space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this surreal dimension, anything that can be imagined can become real, and inexplicable phenomena are part of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore the Weird World through the perspective of a memory lost machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, people live under a strange rule that anyone\u2019s recent combat record automatically appears when you encounter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To boost their win rates, people aggressively challenge each other to fights and you are no exception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in conversations and battles, interact with the bizarre residents of the Weird World, and uncover the truth behind this strange land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal Comedy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weird comedy unfolds in a world where common sense no longer applies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll meet eccentric characters, get caught in absurd events, and embrace the freedom of imagination beyond logic and reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D First-Person Real-Time Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight from a first-person perspective in 2D environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React in real-time with attacks, guards, and dodges to counter your opponent\u2019s moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge a variety of skilled fighters in the Weird World, each with their own techniques and battle styles, and build up your combat record.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Novel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game unfolds as a visual novel, where rich dialogue and multiple choices let you gather information and shape the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will determine the fate of the world and yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075850?t=1761371675","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/72d374b277171d7404b82c0a3c61eacc64ee46a8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761371675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/be6ba9a18c6289f921290d2d803f0bfa5827cbe1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761371675","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/be6ba9a18c6289f921290d2d803f0bfa5827cbe1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761371675","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4119230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in the mysterious realm of the Weird World where the mind manifests as physical space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this surreal dimension, anything that can be imagined can become real, and inexplicable phenomena are part of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore the Weird World through the perspective of a memory lost machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, people live under a strange rule that anyone\u2019s recent combat record automatically appears when you encounter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To boost their win rates, people aggressively challenge each other to fights and you are no exception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in conversations and battles, interact with the bizarre residents of the Weird World, and uncover the truth behind this strange land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal Comedy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weird comedy unfolds in a world where common sense no longer applies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll meet eccentric characters, get caught in absurd events, and embrace the freedom of imagination beyond logic and reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D First-Person Real-Time Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight from a first-person perspective in 2D environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React in real-time with attacks, guards, and dodges to counter your opponent\u2019s moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge a variety of skilled fighters in the Weird World, each with their own techniques and battle styles, and build up your combat record.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Novel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game unfolds as a visual novel, where rich dialogue and multiple choices let you gather information and shape the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will determine the fate of the world and yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Rayos Fotonicos"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075850/82a79a0816e6a5919348329f2dd6442c5e11a5a0/header.jpg?t=1761371675","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{